Terraform is an Infrastructure as Code (IaC) tool.
It is used to create and manage cloud infrastructure.
Terraform supports cloud platforms like AWS, Azure, and GCP.
It uses .tf files to define infrastructure.
Terraform uses a declarative approach—we define what we want.
terraform init initializes the Terraform project.
terraform plan shows what changes Terraform will make.
terraform apply creates or updates the infrastructure.
terraform destroy removes the infrastructure managed by Terraform.
Terraform helps make infrastructure automated, consistent, and repeatable
